OL,3,GNEWSAWorld War Two field gun a step
OL,4,Acloser to new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a historic 25-pounder field
OL,7,Fgun used during World War Two have
OL,8,Ftaken a step closer to the landmark
OL,9,Fgoing on display again.
OL,11,FRushmoor Borough Council said 585
OL,12,Fpeople had completed a recent survey on
OL,13,Fthe future location of Aldershot's
OL,14,FBritish Artillery field gun.
OL,16,FThe Hampshire authority said the gun's
OL,17,Fformer site at the town's railway
OL,18,Fstation was most popular, with Princes
OL,19,FGardens receiving the second highest
OL,20,Fvote.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
